   "id": 666461,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "What are the printed values in the output?",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1328436,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">1 1 2 3 5 8 13 </code>",
     "correctness": "1.0",
     "feedback_html": "The code first prints the variable <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">f</code>'s initial value. Then, at each iteration, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">g</code>'s value is printed, and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">g</code>'s value throughout the code's execution will be <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">1</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">2</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">3</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">5</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">8</code>, and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">13</code>. Thus, all printed values are <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">1</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">1</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">2</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">3</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">5</code>, <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">8</code>, and <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">13</code>."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328437,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">1 2 3 5 8 13 </code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "The loop runs for <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">g =</code> 1, 2, 3, 5, 8, and 13. An additional 1 is printed in line 4 of the program and hence, the printed values are 1 1 2 3 5 8 13."
    },
    {
     "id": 1328438,
     "content_html": "<code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">1 1 2 3 5 8 13 21 </code>",
     "correctness": "0.0",
     "feedback_html": "For g = 21, the loop condition is evaluated to False and therefore <code class=\"python\" data-lang=\"python\">g = 21</code> will not be printed."
    }
   ],
